# Lighting's Bake on tests/editorshots/bakelight, a copy of it (the bake
# writes a file and names it in the scene): the light of the parts with
# BakedLight on is worked out and its file written. Coordinates are a 1600 by
# 900 frame's.
wait 60
click 170 106
wait 4
text Lighting
wait 12
click 116 134
wait 30
move 1420 500
wheel -40
wait 8
wheel -40
wait 8
wheel -40
wait 8
click 1279 860
move 760 340
# Until the bake's file is written, however slow the machine.
idle 60000
wait 10
shot baked
quit
